00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.540
That's right. I'm able to see your name and lifespan right now.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:29.960
If I converted that-

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:35.140
At a human time, I could tell you how many years you've got left, but there's no way I'd ever tell you that.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.290
I may have a big mouth, but even I wouldn't go that far.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:47.100
Shinigami never have to worry that they won't be able to kill a person just because they don't know their name.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:52.560
And every time we do take a life, we always know exactly how many years we're going to receive.

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:58.150
Our eyes just aren't the same, and that is the difference between you and I.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:07.850
However, if a Shinigami drops his Death Note and a human picks it up, he can grant that human the eyes of a Shinigami.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:13.320
But only if a deal is made, one that's been with us since ancient times.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.480
And what's the deal?

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.380
The price for having a Shinigami's eyes...

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:23.130
...is half of that person's remaining lifespan.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:27.300
That's all it is for my remaining lifespan.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:28.900
Yeah.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.940
In other words, if you were supposed to live another 50 years, it'll be 25.

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:36.780
If it was one more year, then six months.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:41.490
I see. And since you've made it clear you're not on anyone's side...

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:42.770
It won't help me out.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.110
You wouldn't just give me the names of people I wanted to kill.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:46.580
Basically.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:49.180
You're saying that I can't simply borrow your powers.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:51.460
pay for them.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:52.570
That's right.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:56.090
It's a key part of the code that all Shinigami are bound by.

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:58.510
I'll say this once more.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:20:59.970
Give me half.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.690
And I'll give you the Shinigami eyes.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:05.450
If I agree...

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.990
I'll be able to know everyone's name just by looking at them.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:13.030
If I had that power, the Death Note would only be easier to use.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:14.820
So...

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:16.150
What'll it be, Light?

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:17.560
Is it a deal?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.260
Thank you for watching!

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:30.800
Thank you for watching!

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:31.740
Thank you for watching!

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:36.250
Dance, dance

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:40.730
Everything has turned out exactly as I wrote it in the Death Note.

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:41.860
to the last detail.

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.390
11.45.

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:47.030
Dot, everything's going just as I planned.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:49.030
The Death Note never fails.
